SYNTHESIS
  The single tail45 covector separates every cheap abstract direction:
  r=2,4,5 lie below the generated tail floor, while r=1,3 lie above the
  generated tail ceiling.  This turns generated-word exclusion into a
  bounded tail45 strip target before relation-code/Delsarte refinement.
